k, so corridor totals can mix simulated moments; suggested fix is showing each direction's elapsedS and marking totals stale."}, {"id": "front_end_dashboard_app_dashboard_scenario_sandbox_scenarios_readme_glm_command_prompt", "label": "Command Prompt (GLM via OpenRouter)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/dashboard/scenario-sandbox/scenarios/README.md", "source_location": "L65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "English/Tagalog/Taglish commands become 21 proposed actions applied only on Apply; server re-checks every field; model z-ai/glm-5.3-flash paid per token; eval 80/80."}, {"id": "front_end_dashboard_app_dashboard_scenario_sandbox_scenarios_readme_sandbox_command_service", "label": "Back-End sandbox-command.service.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/dashboard/scenario-sandbox/scenarios/README.md", "source_location": "L69", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "front_end_dashboard_app_dashboard_scenario_sandbox_scenarios_readme_seeds_by_direction", "label": "Seeds by Direction (12345, +7919)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/dashboard/scenario-sandbox/scenarios/README.md", "source_location": "L159", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Widely spaced seeds because adjacent mulberry32 seeds can correlate and would sync arrival bursts across carriageways; NB keeps 12345 for reproducibility."}, {"id": "front_end_dashboard_app_dashboard_scenario_sandbox_scenarios_readme_direction_bucket_consistency", "label": "directionBucketsConsistent / addEventToBucket", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/dashboard/scenario-sandbox/scenarios/README.md", "source_location": "L170", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Direction is stored both as a field and as the bucket so drift is detectable; enforced at storage."}, {"id"